{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bCorporate Judge: Ctrl+Alt-Get Even!\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This RPG Maker-crafted strategy game weaponizes your workplace trauma into cathartic combat. Experience the ultimate &quot;anti-hustle&quot; fantasy of toppling toxic CEOs and yeeting unreasonable deadlines into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u98de\u4e6620240130-103635.gif?t=1745928556\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200bWarning to Under-35 Wage Slaves:\u200b</strong>\u200b May cause accidental deployment of sass during performance reviews. Handle with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>GamePlay: Tower of Druaga +\u00a0Persona</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay blends <i>Tower of Druaga</i>'s tactical battles with <i>Persona</i>'s social mechanics, remixed with puzzle-solving (imagine rearranging Jira tickets), match-3 stress relief (combo those TPS reports!), and roguelike office politics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/CG\u63d2\u56fe1\u2014\u2014\u6237\u5ddd\u7ffc\u7ad9\u5728\u516c\u53f8\u697c\u9876.png?t=1745928556\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Story:\u00a0Rookie Programmer meets Mysterious Cat</i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in Cyber-Tokyo's corporate dystopia, you play as \u200b<strong>\u200bTogawa Tsubasa\u200b</strong>\u200b - a rookie programmer who accidentally sold her soul to Blackstone Corp. By day, she's a code monkey surviving micromanagement hell. By night, her consciousness rebels in the \u200b<strong>\u200bMidnight World\u200b</strong>\u200b after meeting Vita, a glitch-spewing cat who turns corporate jargon into combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u82f1\u65871.gif?t=1745928556\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit fellow broken souls from accounting purgatory and HR hellscape. Weaponize their burnout as special abilities. Storm the C-suite labyrinth where your manager's &quot;culture-building exercises&quot; have literally summoned a KPI Demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u82f1\u65873.gif?t=1745928556\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u82f1\u8bed.gif?t=1745928556\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2607260/8763ca7330b6e6b5d7cac24dee6a3e2e64e70227.jpg"},{"name":"Full-Time Employee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2607260/a8f50ff667785fbfdab7192fe0a1c0f19dc8eaad.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2607260/bef313f2e36351a05093045016ddbc1c0df0750f.jpg"},{"name":"Company Fossil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2607260/944a21534181d5b43ef828288fd0dd93bfdf4540.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1: The Judge of Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2607260/78781a0dced79490189f08fc375b8dc443285ff2.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2: The Girl Who Fell from the Sky","path"